### A route that doesn't exist (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/nothing-here

### Broken JSON in the body (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": }

### First page of recipes (24 per page, most popular first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes

### Vegetarian desserts ready in 30 minutes, quickest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes?course=Dessert&diet=vegetarian&maxTime=30&sort=quickest

### Page 2, with 5 per page
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes?page=2&limit=5

### Bad values (expect 400 with a message for each field)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes?course=Lunch&limit=500&page=abc

### The allowed values for each filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes/filters


### Search: best matches first (+ means a space in a URL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes?q=paneer+butter+masala&limit=5

### Search inside one course
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes?q=dosa&course=Breakfast&limit=5

### A half-typed word: falls back to matching letters inside titles
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes?q=panee&limit=5

### One recipe, with similar dishes
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes/masala-karela

### A recipe that doesn't exist (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes/no-such-dish

### Not a valid slug (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes/Masala_Karela